        (r"""我把买回来的咖啡一杯杯放到桌上，动作很轻。""", r"""I set the coffees we'd bought down on the table one by one as gently as I could."""),
        (r"""灯光落下来，把他们的侧脸照得很柔和。""", r"""The light fell across them and softened the lines of their faces."""),
        (r"""明明桌面乱得一塌糊涂，可不知道为什么，看起来却一点都不狼狈。""", r"""The table was a complete mess, and yet somehow it didn't look pitiful at all."""),
        (r"""反而让人觉得很温暖。""", r"""If anything, it felt warm."""),
        (r"""大概是因为，这种乱七八糟本身就说明了一件事。""", r"""Maybe it was because this kind of chaos proved something all by itself."""),
        (r"""他们是真的一直待到了最后一刻。""", r"""They really had stayed until the very last moment."""),
        (r"""一直撑着、改着、做着，直到再也撑不住，才就这么趴在桌上睡着了。""", r"""They kept holding on, revising, and working until they couldn't anymore, and only then fell asleep right there on the table."""),
        (r"""明明刚才还说要继续。""", r"""They were still saying they were going to keep going just a little while ago."""),
        (r"""结果还是全倒下了。""", r"""And in the end, every last one of them crashed."""),
        (r"""我们对视了一眼，都很轻地笑了。""", r"""We looked at each other and both laughed softly."""),
        (r"""那笑声很浅，浅得几乎要融进空调的风声里。""", r"""The sound was so faint it nearly disappeared into the hum of the air conditioner."""),
        (r"""可我站在那一刻，却忽然觉得，这可能是这段时间里，我最喜欢的一个画面。""", r"""But standing there, I suddenly felt like this might be my favorite image from all the days we'd spent together."""),
        (r"""第二天下午，多媒体教室里比平时更吵一些。""", r"""The next afternoon, the multimedia classroom was noisier than usual."""),
        (r"""投影亮着，前面的组正在展示。""", r"""The projector was on, and the group ahead of us was presenting."""),
        (r"""后排有人低声说话，也有人翻着自己的讲稿，空气里有种很明显的“大家都在等轮到自己”的紧张感。""", r"""Some people in the back were talking under their breath, others were flipping through their notes, and the air carried that obvious tension of everyone waiting for their own turn."""),
        (r"""轮到我们之前，我一直觉得自己还算镇定。""", r"""Up until our turn, I'd thought I was staying pretty calm."""),
        (r"""可等真正坐在位置上，看着老师一组一组往下叫，我才发现——还是会紧张。""", r"""But once I was actually in my seat, watching the teacher call on each group one after another, I realized I was nervous after all."""),
        (r"""而且是那种非常真实、完全压不下去的紧张。""", r"""And it was the kind of very real nervousness I couldn't force back down."""),
        (r"""怎么办，我好紧张……""", r"""What do I do? I'm so nervous..."""),
        (r"""别慌别慌。""", r"""Don't panic, don't panic."""),
        (r"""我们昨天都熬成那样了，总不能今天死在最后一步吧。""", r"""We stayed up that hard yesterday. We can't die on the very last step today."""),
        (r"""你说得一点安慰作用都没有。""", r"""That is not comforting at all."""),
        (r"""我这不是在稳定军心吗。""", r"""I'm trying to keep morale together here."""),
        (r"""话是这么说，可他自己的声音其实也有点发飘。""", r"""That's what he said, but even his own voice sounded a little floaty."""),
        (r"""Suzu低头看着打印出来的展示稿，最后又顺了一遍流程。""", r"""Suzu looked down at the printed presentation script and ran through the flow one last time."""),
        (r"""Saku坐在旁边，手指轻轻搭在平板边上，平时就不怎么显露情绪的人，这会儿看起来更安静了。""", r"""Saku sat beside us with her fingers resting lightly on the edge of her tablet. Someone who already didn't show much emotion somehow seemed even quieter now."""),
        (r"""我深吸了一口气，又缓缓吐出来。""", r"""I took a deep breath and let it out slowly."""),
        (r"""最后一次确认：开场Taku，结构Suzu，收尾我。我们一起上。""", r"""One last check: Taku opens, Suzu covers the structure, and I close. We do this together."""),
        (r"""几个人几乎同时点头，紧张感还在，但节奏立住了。""", r"""They all nodded almost at the same time. The nerves were still there, but the rhythm had settled."""),
        (r"""我没有临时改计划，只按既定流程把最后一遍顺完。""", r"""I didn't change the plan at the last second. I just walked us through the final run exactly as planned."""),
        (r"""大家都没多说话，但动作明显更稳。""", r"""Nobody said much, but everyone's movements were clearly steadier."""),
        (r"""我迟疑了一下，大家都在等那句最终确认。""", r"""I hesitated for a second. Everyone was waiting for that final word of confirmation."""),
        (r"""气氛短暂发紧，直到老师念到我们组才匆忙起身。""", r"""The atmosphere tightened for a moment, and we only hurried to our feet once the teacher called our group."""),
        (r"""就在这时，老师念到了我们组。""", r"""And right then, the teacher called on our group."""),
        (r"""我们几个人一起站到前面的时候，我心跳快得有点夸张。""", r"""When the six of us stepped up to the front together, my heartbeat was racing so hard it felt almost ridiculous."""),
        (r"""教室里一下子安静了很多。""", r"""The room suddenly got a lot quieter."""),
        (r"""投影幕布亮着，标题页出现在屏幕上。""", r"""The projection screen glowed, and the title page appeared on it."""),
        (r"""《Six Harmonies》。""", r"""Six Harmonies."""),
        (r"""下面是那句我们最开始就定下来的概念说明：六个人一起制作一款游戏的故事。""", r"""Beneath it was the concept line we'd settled on from the very beginning: a story about six people making a game together."""),
        (r"""负责开场的是Taku。""", r"""Taku was handling the opening."""),
        (r"""他把电脑接上投影，调整好页面，然后抬头看向老师和台下的同学。""", r"""He connected the laptop to the projector, adjusted the page, and then looked up at the teacher and the students in the room."""),
        (r"""他说得很顺畅，没有故作轻松，也没有乱发挥。""", r"""He spoke smoothly, without forcing a casual tone and without going off-script."""),
        (r"""台下原本还有一点小小的杂音，这会儿也慢慢安静了下来。""", r"""There had still been a little background noise in the room, but by then it had gradually quieted down."""),
        (r"""我站在旁边，忽然有点想笑。""", r"""Standing beside him, I suddenly wanted to laugh a little."""),
        (r"""因为“everyday collaboration”这种词，从他嘴里说出来居然也挺像那么回事。""", r"""Because somehow, hearing a phrase like "everyday collaboration" come out of his mouth actually sounded pretty convincing."""),
        (r"""接下来是Suzu。""", r"""Next came Suzu."""),
        (r"""他的语速不快，发音也很清晰。""", r"""He wasn't speaking fast, and his pronunciation was clear."""),
        (r"""讲到制作思路、资源分配和进度控制的时候，逻辑非常稳。""", r"""When he talked about the production approach, resource allocation, and schedule control, his logic was rock solid."""),
        (r"""台下有人轻轻点头，老师也一直在看我们这边，没有打断。""", r"""A few people in the room nodded lightly, and the teacher kept watching us without interrupting."""),
        (r"""然后，终于到了试玩展示。""", r"""Then, finally, it was time for the demo."""),
        (r"""Rei把试玩版本打开的时候，我心里一下子又提了起来。""", r"""The moment Rei opened the demo build, my heart jumped right back into my throat."""),
        (r"""毕竟昨晚虽然已经做了最后调整，但那毕竟是我们这个游戏。""", r"""We had done the final round of adjustments last night, but this was still our game."""),
        (r"""谁也不能百分之百保证，它不会在这种最关键的时候，突然给我们来一点惊喜。""", r"""No one could guarantee one hundred percent that it wouldn't choose the single most critical moment to throw us a surprise."""),
        (r"""拜托了，这次千万别再突然把立绘放到占满全屏……""", r"""Please, just don't suddenly blow a sprite up to fill the entire screen again this time..."""),
        (r"""好在，游戏运行得很顺。""", r"""Luckily, the game ran smoothly."""),
        (r"""标题画面出来了。背景切换正常，BGM正常，对话框正常，角色立绘也老老实实待在该在的位置上。""", r"""The title screen appeared. The background changes were normal, the BGM was normal, the dialogue box was normal, and the character sprites stayed exactly where they were supposed to."""),
        (r"""我心里那口气终于稍微松下去一点。""", r"""The breath I'd been holding finally eased a little."""),
        (r"""教室里的投影幕布上，开场画面一点点展开。""", r"""On the classroom screen, the opening scene unfolded bit by bit."""),
        (r"""Hina写的那段开头，在音乐和画面配合下比平时更有氛围。""", r"""The opening Hina wrote felt even more atmospheric than usual with the music and visuals behind it."""),
        (r"""Saku的人设和UI颜色放在一起很统一，整体感觉很稳。""", r"""Saku's character designs and the UI colors looked very cohesive together, and the whole thing felt steady."""),
        (r"""Rei接进去的节奏也很好，文字和切换都很顺。""", r"""Rei's implementation pacing was good too, and the text and transitions all flowed smoothly."""),
        (r"""到第一个选择点出现的时候，前排甚至有同学明显往前坐了一点。""", r"""By the time the first choice appeared, I could see a few people in the front row leaning forward in their seats."""),
        (r"""有人小声说：“哇塞，这个感觉真不赖欸。”""", r"""Someone whispered, 'Wow, this feels really good.'"""),
        (r"""也有人说：“好高的完成度。”""", r"""Someone else said, 'The level of polish is really high.'"""),
        (r"""试玩结束以后，教室里短暂地安静了一下。""", r"""After the demo ended, the classroom went quiet for a moment."""),
        (r"""然后，有人开始鼓掌了。""", r"""Then someone started clapping."""),
        (r"""不是那种很敷衍的、意思一下的掌声。""", r"""Not the perfunctory kind of applause people give just to be polite."""),
        (r"""是真的有人看完以后，下意识鼓起了掌。""", r"""People really had watched it and started clapping on instinct."""),
        (r"""而且很快，其他人也跟着一起鼓了起来。""", r"""And very quickly, everyone else joined in too."""),
        (r"""那一瞬间，我鼻子忽然有点酸。""", r"""At that moment, my eyes suddenly stung a little."""),
        (r"""因为直到这时，我才终于真正有了“我们真的做完了”的实感。""", r"""Because it wasn't until then that it finally truly hit me: we'd really finished it."""),
        (r"""轮到我收尾的时候，我往前走了一步。""", r"""When it was my turn to close, I stepped forward."""),
        (r"""说不紧张是假的。""", r"""I'd be lying if I said I wasn't nervous."""),
        (r"""可当我抬头看见幕布上的标题，看见身边站着的他们，又看见台下那些正在认真看着我们的人时，心里反而慢慢稳下来了。""", r"""But when I looked up and saw the title on the screen, saw them standing beside me, and saw the people below watching us seriously, my heart slowly settled instead."""),
        (r"""我的声音一开始还有点紧。""", r"""My voice was still a little tight at first."""),
        (r"""可说到后面，反而越来越顺了。""", r"""But the farther I got, the more naturally the words started to come."""),
        (r"""因为这些话，本来就不是硬想出来的。""", r"""Because these weren't words I had forced myself to come up with."""),
        (r"""而是这两周里，我们真的一步一步走过来的东西。""", r"""They were things we had really walked through together, one step at a time, over these past two weeks."""),
        (r"""最后一个词落下的时候，我自己都能听见心跳声。""", r"""When the last word left my mouth, I could hear my own heartbeat."""),
        (r"""可下一秒，教室里又响起了掌声。""", r"""And the next second, applause rose through the classroom again."""),
        (r"""这次比刚刚还要更明显一点。""", r"""This time it was even more obvious than before."""),
        (r"""我转头看向身边的人。""", r"""I turned to look at the people beside me."""),
        (r"""Taku在笑，Hina眼睛亮亮的，Rei很轻地呼了口气，Saku低着头，可嘴角明显是扬着的。""", r"""Taku was smiling. Hina's eyes were shining. Rei let out a quiet breath. Saku had her head lowered, but the corners of her mouth were clearly lifted."""),
        (r"""而Suzu站在那里，神情比平时柔和了很多。""", r"""And Suzu was standing there with a much gentler expression than usual."""),
        (r"""那一瞬间，我忽然觉得——足够了。""", r"""In that moment, I suddenly felt--this was enough."""),
        (r"""不管最后成绩怎么样，至少这一刻，我们已经把该做到的东西，都认真地做到最后了。""", r"""No matter what grade we got in the end, at least in this moment, we had truly carried everything we were supposed to do all the way through."""),
        (r"""从讲台前走回座位，再从教室里出来，整个过程都像还有点不真实。""", r"""Walking back to our seats from the front, and then out of the classroom afterward, the whole thing still felt a little unreal."""),
        (r"""直到站到走廊上，被外面的风一吹，我才终于慢慢有了“啊，结束了”的感觉。""", r"""It wasn't until I stood in the corridor and felt the wind from outside that I slowly got that sense of, ah, it's over."""),
        (r"""老师后来的评价很好。""", r"""The teacher's comments afterward were good."""),
        (r"""他说我们的主题很明确，完成度也比预想中高。""", r"""He said our theme was clear, and our level of completion was higher than he had expected."""),
        (r"""最重要的是，他能感觉到，这个项目不是单纯把任务拆给不同的人去做完的。""", r"""Most importantly, he could tell this wasn't just a project where the work had been split up and finished separately by different people."""),
        (r"""而是真的有“团队一起完成”的痕迹。""", r"""There were real traces of something made by a team together."""),
        (r"""我听到这句话的时候，心里忽然轻轻动了一下。""", r"""When I heard that, something in my chest shifted softly."""),
        (r"""因为如果是最开始的我们，大概谁也不会想到，最后会被用这种话来形容。""", r"""Because if you'd shown those words to the version of us at the beginning, none of us would've imagined they would describe us in the end."""),
        (r"""那时候的我们，甚至连坐在一张桌子边上都还带着点陌生和别扭。""", r"""Back then, even sitting around the same table still felt a little unfamiliar and awkward."""),
        (r"""可现在，居然真的已经走到了这里。""", r"""And yet now, somehow, we'd really made it this far."""),
        (r"""傍晚，太阳已经慢慢往下落了。""", r"""By evening, the sun had already started sinking lower."""),
        (r"""教学楼外的人来来往往，树影被拉得很长，风吹过来的时候，叶子会发出很轻的响声。""", r"""People were coming and going outside the teaching building, the tree shadows were stretched long, and whenever the wind passed through, the leaves made a soft rustling sound."""),
        (r"""和最开始那天相比，校园其实没什么变化。""", r"""Compared to that first day, the campus itself hadn't really changed."""),
        (r"""可我知道，还是不一样了。""", r"""But I knew it was different anyway."""),
        (r"""这两周里，我们一起争过、笑过、卡住过，也一起熬过夜。""", r"""Over these two weeks, we'd argued together, laughed together, gotten stuck together, and stayed up late together."""),
        (r"""中间当然也有很难受的时候。""", r"""Of course, there had been painful moments too."""),
        (r"""有说错话的时候，有彼此理解不了的时候，也有过一瞬间觉得“是不是要搞砸了”的时候。""", r"""There were times when the wrong words came out, times when we couldn't understand each other, and moments when it felt like everything might fall apart."""),
        (r"""可到最后，我们还是一起把它做完了。""", r"""But in the end, we still finished it together."""),
        (r"""不是因为谁一个人特别厉害，也不是因为从头到尾都很顺利。""", r"""Not because any one person carried everything, and not because things had gone smoothly from start to finish."""),
        (r"""而是因为每个人都在自己的位置上，认真地往前走了一点。""", r"""It was because each person, in their own place, took one sincere step forward."""),
        (r"""然后那些“一点”，最后就真的拼成了完整的东西。""", r"""And in the end, all those little bits really did fit together into something whole."""),
        (r"""我抬起头，看见他们几个人正站在前面等我。""", r"""I looked up and saw the others standing ahead of me, waiting."""),
        (r"""Taku正在朝我挥手，表情看起来又像是准备说什么多余的话。""", r"""Taku was waving at me, looking like he was just about to say something unnecessary again."""),
        (r"""Hina抱着本子，笑着看过来。""", r"""Hina was holding her notebook and smiling over at me."""),
        (r"""Rei站在旁边，还是那副“快点，不然我先走了”的样子。""", r"""Rei was standing nearby with that same 'Hurry up, or I'm leaving without you' look."""),
        (r"""Saku安静地站着，发尾被风吹得轻轻晃了一下。""", r"""Saku stood there quietly, and the ends of her hair swayed lightly in the wind."""),
        (r"""Suzu回过头，目光落在我身上。""", r"""Suzu turned back, his gaze falling on me."""),
        (r"""我忽然觉得，Six Harmonies 这个名字，好像真的挺适合我们的。""", r"""All of a sudden, it felt like the name Six Harmonies really did suit us."""),
        (r"""六个人，六种完全不一样的声音。""", r"""Six people, six completely different voices."""),
        (r"""最开始的时候，谁都不太合拍。""", r"""At the beginning, none of us were really in sync."""),
        (r"""可是在不断碰撞、靠近、磨合以后，还是一点点拼成了现在这个样子。""", r"""But after all the collisions, the getting closer, and the adjustments, we still pieced ourselves into what we were now, little by little."""),
        (r"""也许并不完美。""", r"""Maybe it wasn't perfect."""),
        (r"""可那的确是只有我们才能做出来的东西。""", r"""But it really was something only we could have made."""),
        (r"""我们按计划完成了展示，流程基本顺下来，但每个人都明显比平时更拘谨。""", r"""We finished the presentation according to plan, and the flow mostly held together, but everyone was noticeably stiffer than usual."""),
        (r"""试玩环节能跑通，不过有几处节奏和转场显得有点生硬。""", r"""The demo section ran, but a few beats and transitions felt a little stiff."""),
        (r"""台下的反应不算差，也不算特别热烈。""", r"""The reaction from the room wasn't bad, but it wasn't especially warm either."""),
        (r"""老师最后给了通过评价。""", r"""In the end, the teacher gave us a passing evaluation."""),
        (r"""他说我们的框架完整、任务也按时交付，但团队之间的配合感还不够自然。""", r"""He said our structure was complete and the assignment had been delivered on time, but the sense of teamwork between us still didn't feel natural enough."""),
        (r"""那句“你们是把项目做完了”，听上去更像一种客观陈述。""", r"""The line, "You did finish the project," sounded more like an objective observation than praise."""),
        (r"""走出教室后，大家都松了口气。""", r"""Once we stepped out of the classroom, everyone let out a breath."""),
        (r"""可那种松弛更像是“终于结束了”，而不是“一起完成了什么”。""", r"""But that relief felt more like 'it's finally over' than 'we accomplished something together.'"""),
        (r"""我们互相说了辛苦，也确认了都通过了这门课。""", r"""We exchanged tired congratulations and confirmed that we'd all passed the course."""),
        (r"""然后就各自收起资料，准备回去。""", r"""Then we each packed up our materials and got ready to head back."""),
        (r"""风还是和来时一样，校园也没什么不同。""", r"""The wind was the same as it had been on the way in, and the campus didn't look any different."""),
        (r"""六个人并肩走了一段路，却没有谁再提“下次一起”。""", r"""The six of us walked side by side for a while, but no one brought up doing it 'again next time.'"""),
        (r"""我们不是闹僵了。""", r"""It wasn't that we'd fallen out."""),
        (r"""只是停在了“合作过的同组同学”这一步。""", r"""We had simply stopped at the point of being classmates who had once worked in the same group."""),
        (r"""我们站上去的时候，呼吸和节奏都没能完全对齐。""", r"""When we stepped up to the front, neither our breathing nor our rhythm had fully synced up."""),
        (r"""开场还算顺利，可试玩刚进行到中段，演示版本就出现了明显卡顿。""", r"""The opening went fairly smoothly, but halfway through the demo, the build started to stutter in a very obvious way."""),
        (r"""选项没有及时响应，转场也断了拍。""", r"""The choices didn't respond in time, and the transitions lost their beat."""),
        (r"""Rei紧急接管操作，Suzu也立刻补说明，但现场还是不可避免地冷了下来。""", r"""Rei hurriedly took over the controls, and Suzu stepped in to explain at once, but the room still went cold anyway."""),
        (r"""展示结束后，教室里先是短暂安静。""", r"""After the presentation ended, the classroom went quiet for a brief moment."""),
        (r"""老师的评价很直接：项目存在关键稳定性问题，且最终呈现未达到课程要求。""", r"""The teacher's assessment was blunt: the project had critical stability issues, and the final presentation did not meet the course requirements."""),
        (r"""Group Seven，本次作业判定不通过。""", r"""Group Seven, this assignment is marked as not passed."""),
        (r"""走廊上的风有点凉。""", r"""The wind in the corridor felt a little cold."""),
        (r"""没人先开口。""", r"""No one spoke first."""),
        (r"""我们都知道这句话的意思：这门课，六个人都挂了。""", r"""We all knew what that meant: all six of us had failed the class."""),
        (r"""后来大家只是各自收拾东西，简单说了句“回头再聊”。""", r"""After that, everyone just packed up their own things and said a brief, 'We'll talk later.'"""),
